      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am sorry you are experiencing such intense feelings of detachment and emptiness; please reach out to a mental health professional who can offer you immediate support and a safe space to explore these experiences. It is completely valid to feel overwhelmed, but these thoughts are often symptoms of a larger issue called depersonalization that responds well to compassionate care and therapy. You are not alone in this, and connecting with a trusted doctor or counselor will help you feel grounded and real again.",
